    "source": "Bitcoin Magazine",
    "summary": "<div class=\"rss-video-container\" style=\"margin-bottom: 20px;\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YL4q0VJ2HRQ\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"display: block; text-decoration: none;\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Watch video\" src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/YL4q0VJ2HRQ/hqdefault.jpg\" /><span>&#9654;</span></a></div><hr style=\"border: 0; border-top: 1px solid #eee; margin-bottom: 20px;\" /><p><a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Magazine</a><br />\n<img src=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/stanford-professor-reveals-praxis-bitcoin-cryptography-breakthrough-YL4q0VJ2HRQ.jpg\" style=\"display: block; margin: 1em auto;\" /><br />\n<a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/videos/stanford-professor-reveals-praxis-bitcoin-cryptography-breakthrough\" rel=\"nofollow\">Stanford Professor Reveals “Praxis” Bitcoin Cryptography Breakthrough</a></p>\n<p>Bitcoin developers have tried for five to 10 years to add covenants through a soft fork, and every effort has stalled.</p>\n<p>This post <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/videos/stanford-professor-reveals-praxis-bitcoin-cryptography-breakthrough\" rel=\"nofollow\">Stanford Professor Reveals “Praxis” Bitcoin Cryptography Breakthrough</a> first appeared on <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bitcoin Magazine</a> and is written by <a href=\"https://bitcoinmagazine.com/authors/patrickgreen\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patrick Green</a>.</p>",
